CANnectivity
------------
https://github.com/CANnectivity/cannectivity
Revision f229e129aa0859b79f2997d1cdc0443e10d97eee (v1.4.0)

app/main.c and app/CMakeLists.txt are adapted from the corresponding files
in CANnectivity's app directory. The adaptations add panda board selection,
harness detection, channel routing and USB connection handling.

Copyright (c) 2024 Henrik Brix Andersen <henrik@brixandersen.dk>

The original files are licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
CANnectivity's USB protocol, descriptors, LED and timestamp sources are
compiled directly from the unmodified dependency checkout.

comma.ai panda
--------------
https://github.com/commaai/panda
Revision f849893bdcfc6cd05d4547d64d2802b5a83f409c

The board definitions and harness orientation/routing behavior are based on
panda's board/boards/{white,black,red}.h, board/drivers/harness.h, and
board/stm32f4 and board/stm32h7 hardware definitions. The implementation here
adapts that information and behavior to Zephyr and CANnectivity.

