Build dependencies
------------------
The pinned dependencies and their original source notices are retained in:

  CANnectivity: deps/cannectivity/LICENSE
  Zephyr:       deps/zephyr/LICENSE
  CMSIS 6:      deps/modules/hal/cmsis_6/LICENSE
  STM32 HAL:    deps/modules/hal/stm32/LICENSE

STM32 HAL contains multiple licenses. In particular, the STM32Cube F4 and H7
peripheral drivers used by these builds are BSD-3-Clause, with license texts
at stm32cube/stm32f4xx/drivers/LICENSE.md and
stm32cube/stm32h7xx/drivers/LICENSE.md within that dependency.

These dependencies are fetched by west; they are not vendored in this repo.
